        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "e60d05d6-630f-4986-a3a6-074e9edb2d69",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "af55460f-367b-4205-a0b3-a43cd490e4f1",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "6a02eac4-b429-4568-a013-f090a9793562",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The packet stays\ndry in a tin\nsleeve. Page ONE\ndefines the\nservice",
                      "hall. Page TWO\ngrants pipe\naccess. Page THREE\nforbids closing\npublic",
                      "branches for\nprivate priority.\nIts seal matches\nthe archive\nsquare,",
                      "not Slush's silver\nstationery."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "612bf4a0-86a1-433f-ad71-cdd80d9fd242",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "29232012-840c-404b-a5cf-e726681b7709",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "31e9864d-23be-45b9-acac-77feacc8c553",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "d84786c2-63ef-4344-a92c-56bee96fd150",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "425d8c52-0ec3-4394-a456-81996d83de78",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "An estate summary\nsays the lodge may\nreserve all heat\nafter paying",
                      "an inspection\ninvoice. Page TWO\ngrants service\naccess, not",
                      "ownership. Page\nTHREE forbids\nclosing public\nbranches for\nprivate",
                      "priority. The\nsummary is\nunsigned; both\nnumbered pages\ncarry the",
                      "city seal. Nib\nrecognizes his old\nphrasing in the\nsummary and admits",
                      "he repeated a\nclaim he had not\nchecked. He asks\nto correct it\nwhere",
                      "everyone can see."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "c411dbff-6629-4f71-ab3b-8ef2b38a029d",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4de7acd2-b544-4780-a86b-4c36ff0401fc",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "65cbe45f-1c4b-4a06-abdf-07b3af2daa4b",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "63f82600-042f-44ff-a88d-beb4dd37a72c",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "d177c5bf-2488-4241-a929-3fc6c0b73132",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Nib: The signature\npage refers to TWO\nfor the access\nright. THREE",
                      "limits how that\nright may be used.\nThe clerk needs\nthe access page",
                      "first, then its\nlimit. I could\nturn this into a\nspeech. I am",
                      "choosing to turn\nit into a packet."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "654fb0ba-2343-4554-aad9-1cdb9ac9bdc0",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1f133431-04bf-44e3-a906-550eda6d635e",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
