          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "be902ab4-23f0-43f1-a7f3-d4f951c65d41",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "be8e3c27-fd2f-4e18-a594-8c66d3f59806",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "aca8acc1-9750-4c50-a369-4c4ac7d3d149",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Which numbered\npage establishes\nthe right to enter\nfor pipe repairs?"
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "801cb337-057b-4ba8-a515-22c69e25ce41",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "afe31c7e-c7cf-4799-aa4b-ee379566c0e9",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "3a9b5813-a566-4f02-a9cf-738b20950f0b",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "50da117e-d772-46d7-a5a1-c0ad34cbe4c5",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "3e67242a-cba7-4dcb-af2c-1b756c51ea86",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Which claim should\nreplace the\nunsigned priority\nsentence? The",
                      "signed pages still\ngive useful repair\naccess, so the\ncorrection must",
                      "not erase that\nright. Compare\nwhat each document\npermits, and let",
                      "the sealed terms\ngovern the\nsummary. Nib will\nput his name\nbeneath",
                      "the correction,\nincluding the\nuncomfortable\nsentence that the",
                      "earlier claim was\nhis mistake."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "c36979be-5a74-4766-a5f6-eb72c1c2d74d",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "84903a0d-89ad-43d7-a48e-e6bbcf80611c",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "25b18ef4-2d61-4f76-ae94-616608d5320b",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "c077beb2-97fc-4150-aea0-4ccf9d39e400",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "2424ea63-f552-48c8-ac03-0cbac33bb337",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The clerk posts\nthe packet beside\nthe wheel. Private\nrooms remain",
                      "private; public\nservice stays\npublic. Slush asks\nfor clear fault",
                      "reports in return.\nPip accepts the\nduty and names\nMoxie as the",
                      "person who will\ncarry reports if a\nwire fails."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "50690a5c-152d-40fc-a7c9-e9fbc2ab2100",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
